---

<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Shawn Stringfield</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Software engineer and author of The AI Survival Kit. I help people connect the tools they already own into a small system that runs their week." />
  <meta property="og:title" content="Shawn Stringfield" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Software engineer and author of The AI Survival Kit. I help people connect the tools they already own into a small system that runs their week." />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="Shawn Stringfield" />
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="Software engineer and author of The AI Survival Kit." />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

  <style is:global>
    *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    :root {
      --bg: #0a0b12;
      --text: #ede9e3;
      --body: #b0aea5;
      --muted: #7a7570;
      --label: #45423e;
      --blue: #89b4d4;
      --blue-hover: #a3c8e4;
      --gold: #e8a838;
      --gold-hover: #d4952e;
      --separator: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.055);
      --surface: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    }

    body {
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    /* ── LAYOUT ── */
    .container {
      max-width: 940px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 36px;
    }

    .container.narrow {
      max-width: 700px;
    }

    /* ── HERO (statement band, centered) ── */
    .hero {
      max-width: 940px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 88px 36px 56px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .avatar {
      width: 120px;
      height: 120px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background-image: url('/shawn.jpg');
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center 20%;
      margin: 0 auto 32px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 64px;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .hero .tagline {
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 520px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    }

    /* ── ACCENT RULE ── */
    .rule {
      width: 32px;
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--blue);
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .section-break {
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--separator);
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* ── SECTION LABEL ── */
    .section-label {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 500;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.4em;
      color: var(--gold);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    /* ── OFFERS (first viewport, two-up) ── */
    .offers {
      padding: 40px 0 80px;
    }

    .offers-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 28px;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    /* Card with top-line callout — gold for the Kit, blue for the Setup */
    .card {
      background: var(--surface);
      padding: 40px 36px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -1px;
      left: 36px;
      width: 120px;
      height: 3px;
      border-radius: 1px;
    }

    .card.gold::before { background: var(--gold); }
    .card.blue::before { background: var(--blue); }

    .card h2 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 34px;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.1;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .card p {
      color: var(--body);
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.75;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .cta-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .card .cta-row { margin-top: auto; }

    .setup-detail .cta-row {
      justify-content: flex-start;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .setup-detail .cta-note {
      margin-bottom: 0;
      max-width: 300px;
      order: 2;
    }

    /* ── CTAS ── */
    .cta-gold {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--gold);
      color: var(--bg);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 15px 36px;
      border-radius: 3px;
      transition: background 0.25s;
    }

    .cta-gold:hover { background: var(--gold-hover); }

    .cta-blue {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--blue);
      color: var(--bg);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 15px 36px;
      border-radius: 3px;
      transition: background 0.25s;
    }

    .cta-blue:hover { background: var(--blue-hover); }

    .cta-note {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .detail-link {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--blue);
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.25s;
    }

    .detail-link:hover { color: var(--blue-hover); }

    /* ── SETUP DETAIL ── */
    .setup-detail {
      padding: 80px 0;
    }

    .setup-detail .section-label {
      padding-bottom: 12px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--separator);
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .setup-detail h2 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 44px;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .setup-detail .intro {
      color: var(--body);
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .setup-detail .list-heading {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text);
      margin: 40px 0 20px;
    }

    .deliverables {
      list-style: none;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .deliverables li {
      padding: 20px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--separator);
      color: var(--body);
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .deliverables li:first-child { padding-top: 0; }
    .deliverables li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

    .deliverables strong {
      display: block;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .setup-detail .arc {
      color: var(--body);
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .setup-detail .price-line {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 30px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .setup-detail .price-line .amount { color: var(--blue); }

    /* ── STORY ── */
    .story {
      padding: 80px 0;
    }

    .story p {
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      color: var(--body);
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .story p.lead {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 30px;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.3;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }

    .story p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    .story em {
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    /* ── PULL QUOTE ── */
    .pull-quote {
      padding: 100px 36px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .pull-quote blockquote {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 40px;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.35;
      color: var(--text);
      max-width: 560px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .pull-quote .accent { color: var(--blue); }

    /* ── CONNECT ── */
    .connect {
      padding: 80px 0 0;
    }

    .connect .section-label {
      padding-bottom: 12px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--separator);
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .connect-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .connect-links a {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      transition: color 0.25s;
      position: relative;
    }

    .connect-links a::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -4px;
      left: 0;
      width: 0;
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--blue);
      transition: width 0.3s;
    }

    .connect-links a:hover { color: var(--text); }
    .connect-links a:hover::after { width: 100%; }

    /* ── FOOTER ── */
    .footer {
      padding: 80px 0 48px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .footer p {
      font-size: 10px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      color: var(--label);
    }

    /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .offers-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 24px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .container { padding: 0 24px; }
      .hero { padding: 56px 24px 40px; }
      .avatar { width: 92px; height: 92px; margin: 0 auto 24px; }
      .hero h1 { font-size: 36px; }
      .hero .tagline { font-size: 16px; }
      .offers { padding: 28px 0 60px; }
      .card { padding: 32px 24px; }
      .card::before { left: 24px; }
      .card h2 { font-size: 26px; }
      .story { padding: 60px 0; }
      .story p.lead { font-size: 22px; }
      .setup-detail { padding: 60px 0; }
      .setup-detail h2 { font-size: 32px; }
      .pull-quote { padding: 60px 24px; }
      .pull-quote blockquote { font-size: 24px; }
      .connect { padding: 60px 0 0; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- ════════ HERO — statement band ════════ -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="avatar"></div>
    <h1>Shawn Stringfield</h1>
    <p class="tagline">Software engineer. Builder of systems.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- ════════ OFFERS — first viewport ════════ -->
  <div class="container">
    <section class="offers">
      <div class="offers-grid">

        <div class="card gold">
          <div class="section-label">The Book</div>
          <h2>The AI Survival Kit</h2>
          <p>A field guide to connecting the tools you already own into a small system that runs your week. Written for real life — dinner, errands, the paperwork you keep meaning to do — not for engineers.</p>
          <div class="cta-row">
            <a href="https://wellrooted.io" class="cta-gold">Get the Kit</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card blue">
          <div class="section-label">Work With Me</div>
          <h2>The Setup</h2>
          <p>The done-with-you version. I take a few people each month and build their system with them — your tools, your week, your hands on the keyboard. Two live sessions and a check-in, and you walk away running it yourself.</p>
          <div class="cta-row">
            <a href="mailto:hello@wellrooted.io?subject=The%20Setup" class="cta-blue">Get in Touch</a>
            <a href="#the-setup" class="detail-link">What you get &darr;</a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="container narrow">

    <!-- ════════ THE STORY ════════ -->
    <section class="story">
      <p class="lead">For years, the most reliable system in my life was my own memory — and it never got a night off.</p>

      <p>On paper I was organized. In real life I paid a late fee on a bill I knew was coming, remembered appointments in parking lots, and wrote replies in my head that never made it to the phone. Every errand, renewal, and promise was filed in one place — my head — and my head was the only copy.</p>

      <p>So I built myself a backstop out of the apps I was already paying for. The first version was more nag than help. Pieces broke — one failed so quietly it took me four days to notice. I kept rebuilding until it earned trust the only way a system can: it started catching what I dropped.</p>

      <p>Here's what that bought me. The late fees stopped. Mornings start with coffee and one screen, not a scramble through apps. A thought I catch in a checkout line comes back exactly when it's useful. And while I'm at work, my life keeps moving without me — bills get flagged, errands get queued, loose ends get chased. The hours and headroom it handed back are how I wrote a book in the margins of a full-time job.</p>

      <p>That book is <em>The AI Survival Kit</em>, and the system behind it became the thing I build with other people — no new apps, just the phone already in your pocket, wired around the way your life actually runs.</p>
    </section>

    <hr class="section-break" />

    <!-- ════════ THE SETUP — DETAIL ════════ -->
    <section class="setup-detail" id="the-setup">
      <div class="section-label">Work With Me</div>
      <h2>The Setup</h2>
      <p class="intro">You're the one everybody counts on to remember everything. The tools are already on your phone — the calendar, the notes, the assistant you pay for every month. What's missing is the wiring between them. It lives in your head, and you never get to set it down.</p>
      <p class="intro">That's what we fix. You walk away with four things:</p>

      <h3 class="list-heading">What you get</h3>
      <ul class="deliverables">
        <li>
          <strong>One place you look each morning</strong>
          Your week pulled into a single view — what's on, what's due, what's about to slip. Out of your head, onto one screen.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>One reliable way to capture</strong>
          A thought, a screenshot, an errand — so it comes back when you need it instead of dying in your camera roll.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Your #1 recurring dread, handled start to finish</strong>
          The dinner decision, the schedule juggling, the bill that always sneaks up. Pick one. We finish it.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>A plain-language map of your system</strong>
          What we built, where it lives, and what to do if it breaks. No diagrams, no jargon. Yours to keep.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p class="arc">The whole thing is a short, fixed arc — about three weeks, two live sessions and a check-in, roughly two hours of your time on calls. Built with your hands on the keyboard, on the tools you already pay for. Nothing new to buy, and nothing that keeps billing you after we're done.</p>

      <p class="price-line"><span class="amount">$300.</span> Two live sessions, one check-in, and a system that's yours to keep.</p>

      <div class="cta-row">
        <span class="cta-note">Tell me the one thing you're tired of carrying. That's where we start.</span>
        <a href="mailto:hello@wellrooted.io?subject=The%20Setup" class="cta-blue">Get in Touch</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="section-break" />

    <!-- ════════ PULL QUOTE ════════ -->
    <div class="pull-quote">
      <blockquote>Your tools were never the problem.<br /><span class="accent">The wiring was.</span></blockquote>
    </div>

    <hr class="section-break" />

    <!-- ════════ CONNECT ════════ -->
    <section class="connect">
      <div class="section-label">Connect</div>
      <div class="connect-links">
        <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/shawnstringfield" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/shawnstringfield" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
        <a href="mailto:hello@wellrooted.io">Email</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ FOOTER ════════ -->
    <footer class="footer">
      <div class="rule" style="margin-bottom: 24px;"></div>
      <p>Shawn Stringfield &middot; Wellrooted &middot; 2026</p>
    </footer>

  </div>

</body>
</html>
